{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01855","headline":"杂曲歌辞 长干行二首 一 · 李白","name":"杂曲歌辞 长干行二首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"妾发初覆额，折花门前剧。\n郎骑竹马来，遶牀弄青梅。\n同居长干里，两小无嫌猜。\n十四爲君妇，羞颜尚不开。\n低头向暗壁，千唤不一回。\n十五始展眉，愿同尘与灰。\n常存抱柱信，岂上望夫台。\n十六君远行，瞿塘灩预堆。\n五月不可触，猨鸣天上哀。\n门前迟行迹，一一生绿苔。\n苔深不能扫，落叶秋风早。\n八月蝴蝶来，双飞西园草。\n感此伤妾心，坐愁红颜老。\n早晚下三巴，预将书报家。\n相迎不道远，直至长风沙。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李白","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_01855.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01855","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}